  <ul>
    <li>A split is two or more rows with the same date and account. The memo starts with <strong>Split (1/2)</strong>, <strong>Split (2/2)</strong>, and so on. The payee on each row can differ.</li>
    <li>A transfer payee is <strong>Transfer :</strong> plus the other account’s name. Each side is its own row.</li>
    <li>Income uses the group Inflow and the category Ready to Assign.</li>
    <li>Cleared is Uncleared, Cleared, or Reconciled.</li>
    <li>Flag may be Red, Orange, Yellow, Green, Blue, or Purple, or a name of your own. During import you match any name that is not already one of those colors.</li>
    <li>A category or group can begin with an emoji. ZxBudget keeps the emoji as the icon.</li>
    <li>A date after today comes in as a one-time upcoming transaction.</li>
    <li>A tracking account can leave Category empty.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Plan</h2>
  <div class="table-scroll">
