  <ul>
    <li>Assigned can be negative when money was moved out of the category.</li>
    <li>A <strong>$0.00</strong> row is left out.</li>
    <li>Activity and Available can be in the file. ZxBudget does not use them.</li>
    <li>A category under Credit Card Payments with the same name as an account marks that account as a credit card.</li>
    <li>A category under Hidden Categories with the same name as an account marks that credit card closed.</li>
  </ul>
